      "text": "[9:07PM] #IyanaOworo #TrafficUpdate \n\nAdekunle to Unilag Waterfront, Ilaje, and Iyana Oworo (both directions) is smooth ride.\nIyana Oworo to Olopo-Meji, Gbagada, and Olamide Badoo (both directions) is good.\nBariga Axis is free flow of traffic from Deeper Life to New Garage.\nGood movement at Muritala to Bariga Roundabout, Ilaje Chemist to Pako, Unilag Gate, and Abule Oja.\nReturn journey from Unilag Gate to Baale is also smooth.\n\nNo impediments reported, with officers effectively managing traffic.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
